<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hedge Wall</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 21)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hedge wall &lt;direction&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cast hedge wall north
</pre>
<p>The caster points at the ground and utters 'Sentire Floralis', and a thick 
wall of vines and brambles grows up across one way out of the room. Write 
the direction out in full: north, east, southwest, up, and so on.
</p><p>Nobody but the caster can get past it that way. The others must cut the 
wall down: it is a living plant of level 30, hard to the touch as chain 
mail. Otherwise it withers away by itself after two minutes.
</p><p>It can't grow indoors, on water or in a swamp, and you must be standing to 
cast it.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Druid Spells</a>
</pre>




</div>